# Domain vocabulary

Read/when-to-open only. Follow `docs/agents/domain.md`. Complements grill-with-docs (writer).

- Open `CONTEXT.md` (or `CONTEXT-MAP.md` + relevant glossaries); ADRs in `docs/adr/` that touch the area.
- Use glossary terms as defined; do not invent synonyms the glossary avoids.
- Missing files → proceed silently; do not create them here.
- Not always-on — do not load full CONTEXT at every session start.
- Writing glossary/ADRs → `/grill-with-docs` or `/domain-modeling`, not this rule.
